017800     05  TRM-OLD-BLKT             PIC X(7).
017900     05  TRM-NEW-BLKT             PIC X(7).
018000     05  TRM-EXP-DATE             PIC X(6).
           05  TRM-COMMAND-LINE         PIC X(79).
           05  TRM-MESSAGE-LINE         PIC X(79).
018200
018300
