019700
019800 COPY DPORECD IN COPYLIB.
019900
020000 COPY DPOITEM IN COPYLIB.
020100
020200 COPY MPLTINFO IN COPYLIB.
020300
020400 COPY DATAB IN COPYLIB.
020500
